- `_convert_blocks_to_transcript_flow()` - converts VADBlocks to HierarchicalTurns
- `_merge_consecutive_same_speaker_blocks()` - reduces fragmentation
- `_create_word_segments_from_block()` - creates APPROXIMATED word timing

**Web Integration Points:**
